    &lt;td style="vertical-align: top; width: 33%;"&gt; &lt;p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Strategy, content production, schema and technical work, off-site authority building, monitoring, and reporting, all managed for you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/td&gt; 
    &lt;td style="vertical-align: top; width: 15%;"&gt; &lt;p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Teams that want the work executed for them and have budget for a managed program&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/td&gt; 
